      "side": 1,
      "message": "I took a brief look.\n\nThis is libabigail XML from before some significant changes to current XML.\nThe actual (harmless) change in ABI that liabigail detects is that\n\n`dev_pm_info`\u0027s `timer_expires` has changed from `unsigned long int` to `u64`.\n\nThe leaf report is correct to omit this. The change is visible with `--leaf-changes-only` and `--harmless`. The change isn\u0027t completely invisible with plain `abidiff` a.k.a. `--full-mode` and this could be a bug.\n\nHowever, it\u0027s hard to say without separating the two things. If I can go back to before `timer_expires` was changed and generate \"new\" XML, then either the problem will vanish or we\u0027ll have something reproducible and worth tracking either here or upstream.\n\nSo, I\u0027ll do that then.",
      "parentUuid": "108bd799_4d2557ac",
